<newsitem itemid="222417" id="root" date="1996-11-28" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Multisource yr shr edges up, div steady.</title>
<headline>Multisource yr shr edges up, div steady.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Aug 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     17.3	  vs 16.8</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 6.0	   vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.56	  vs 1.51</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   2.48	  vs 2.32</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.93	  vs 0.81</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.79	  vs 0.47</p>
<p>    Turnover		  11.56	 vs 13.63</p>
<p>Div payable Jan 13</p>
<p>on register Dec 27</p>
<p>Full name: Multisource Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said amid a depressed local communications market, they had started exploring export opportunities. Results had been encouraging and it was envisaged that business outside South Africa would grow.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
